      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-25T13:00:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we have a place that all tests execute before they run? If so, (2) might just work. I could have used such a place in the past (when I was wrangling with buildDir / absolutePath / srcDir / environment variables), but I didn\u0027t find anything after a perfunctory look. Maybe it\u0027s time to create such a thing?\n\n(but ideally, this should be done through a testing-only object, with your test fixture framework looks suitable for)",
      "parentUuid": "585aa0e8_1ca5ebb0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 178,
