      "writtenOn": "2021-03-25T14:52:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Another way to protect against this being used at runtime is simply to make it return on invalid path, e.g. instead of `out/soong/....` return `\u003ctop\u003e/out/soong/`.",
      "parentUuid": "e1877167_0cabc8cc",
      "range": {
