      "message": "The TestContext (TestResult) objects are the best place for those. They return TestingModule/TestingSingleton objects (amongst others), which in turn can return TestingBuildParams objects. A follow up change uses the functionality added in this to fix those objects up so they always return \u0027relative to top\u0027 paths.",
